  "notes": "12-step purple scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: purpleA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/purple.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/purple-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --purple-1: #fefcfe;\n  --purple-2: #fbf7fe;\n  --purple-3: #f7edfe;\n  --purple-4: #f2e2fc;\n  --purple-5: #ead5f9;\n  --purple-6: #e0c4f4;\n  --purple-7: #d1afec;\n  --purple-8: #be93e4;\n  --purple-9: #8e4ec6;\n  --purple-10: #8347b9;\n  --purple-11: #8145b5;\n  --purple-12: #402060;\n}\n.dark {\n  --purple-1: #18111b;\n  --purple-2: #1e1523;\n  --purple-3: #301c3b;\n  --purple-4: #3d224e;\n  --purple-5: #48295c;\n  --purple-6: #54346b;\n  --purple-7: #664282;\n  --purple-8: #8457aa;\n  --purple-9: #8e4ec6;\n  --purple-10: #9a5cd0;\n  --purple-11: #d19dff;\n  --purple-12: #ecd9fa;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix purple</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fefcfe\" title=\"--purple-1: #fefcfe\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#fbf7fe\" title=\"--purple-2: #fbf7fe\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#f7edfe\" title=\"--purple-3: #f7edfe\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#f2e2fc\" title=\"--purple-4: #f2e2fc\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#ead5f9\" title=\"--purple-5: #ead5f9\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#e0c4f4\" title=\"--purple-6: #e0c4f4\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#d1afec\" title=\"--purple-7: #d1afec\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#be93e4\" title=\"--purple-8: #be93e4\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#8e4ec6\" title=\"--purple-9: #8e4ec6\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#8347b9\" title=\"--purple-10: #8347b9\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#8145b5\" title=\"--purple-11: #8145b5\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#402060\" title=\"--purple-12: #402060\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#18111b\" title=\"--purple-1: #18111b\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#1e1523\" title=\"--purple-2: #1e1523\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#301c3b\" title=\"--purple-3: #301c3b\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#3d224e\" title=\"--purple-4: #3d224e\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#48295c\" title=\"--purple-5: #48295c\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#54346b\" title=\"--purple-6: #54346b\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#664282\" title=\"--purple-7: #664282\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#8457aa\" title=\"--purple-8: #8457aa\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#8e4ec6\" title=\"--purple-9: #8e4ec6\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#9a5cd0\" title=\"--purple-10: #9a5cd0\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#d19dff\" title=\"--purple-11: #d19dff\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#ecd9fa\" title=\"--purple-12: #ecd9fa\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
